ations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Shopping in the Airport"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can visit different shops in the airport like:<br />  <ul>    \t<li>gift shops </li>  \t<li>clothing stores </li>  \t<li>duty-free shops: These shops sell items you can bring into a country without paying taxes</li>  \t</ul><br /><br />  When you are in a shop, you can use these expressions to ask where things are:<br /> <ul>  <span class=\"italic\"><li>I'm looking for \u2026  </li> <li>Do you have any \u2026 ?</li> <li>Where are the \u2026 ? </li> <li>Could you tell me where the \u2026 is?</li> <li>How much ... ?</li></span>  </ul>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in particular "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to indicate something specific  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you looking for anything in particular?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear when shopping at the airport."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "roller "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a carry on bag which contains wheels "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Where are the rollers?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "duffel bag "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large cloth bag with handles used to carry personal belongings  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like to check your duffel bag? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swivel "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a device that joins together two parts so that one of the parts can spin "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This roller has swivel wheels. It's great for travel!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "compartment "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a space that is part of something larger and used to hold specific things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This carry-on has a few compartments to keep your things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "PIN "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "personal identification number; a secret number you use with your credit or debit card "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please enter your PIN."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to prompt "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to show a message that tells you to do something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can enter your PIN when the machine prompts you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le09ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking For Things in a Shop"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Here are some useful questions you can use in a store. Note that some of these questions use the modals  <span class=\"strong\">can</span> and <span class=\"strong\">could</span> to express polite requests, while other use <span class=\"italic\">Simple Present tense</span> in interrogative form.."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Can</span> I pay with this card?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could</span> you tell me where I pay?"}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Do</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have</span> any rollers?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select an airport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Visit the airport's website."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out what shops are in the airport. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the shops you would like to go to and why?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your list with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify an airport's website."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of shops I want to go to and why."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my preferences with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}